        "id": 122930,
        "name": "Lord Flash Fire",
        "username": "Lord_Flash_Fire",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lord_flash_fire/{size}/2071_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-10T20:56:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Let's get statistical...</p><p>Out of 20 games,&nbsp;</p><p><strong>Heroes</strong></p><p>5-7 games with be with people from Team NightFlame (Devra, Tach, LegC, Fanatic, Ra)</p><p>7-10 times, I'll randomize.</p><p>3-8 times, I'll have others choose for me.</p><p><b>Villain (when I choose)</b></p><p>~7 games will be with an Infernal Relics villain</p><p>1-2 games will be with Kaarga Warfang</p><p>The rest I randomize.</p><p><strong>Environment (again, when I choose)</strong></p><p>Always random unless we've played it recently. Although I am always slightly hoping for Tomb of Anubis or Rook City.</p>",
        "post_number": 21,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:56:44.827Z",
