        "id": 122932,
        "name": "VisforYoshi",
        "username": "VisforYoshi",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/visforyoshi/{size}/2185_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-11T15:53:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>My group typically chooses the heros first, then the villain and environment. Mainy because if I choose the villain first, then I know a lot of people are going to choose a team to counter the villain, which takes a lot of the fun out of the game for me</p>",
