        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/medic-tank/{size}/2107_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-11T17:14:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I usually go full random. I may pass spite for boringness... And be a bit more choosy for the Chairman or Miss Information as far as needing some roles fullfilled for a better time.</p>",
