        "id": 122934,
        "name": "Dandolo",
        "username": "Dandolo",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dandolo/{size}/1845_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-11T17:57:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I randomly choose my games using a VBA excel sheet I made.   Each game I generate both a normal Villain and a team of Vengeance Villains and then decide which game looks more fun.  If none of the options look fun I will re-randomize everything.</p>",
