      {
        "id": 122935,
        "name": "emcg575797",
        "username": "emcg575797",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/emcg575797/{size}/2440_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-12T07:36:41.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When playing the physical game, I tend to play heroes\\enviroments which aren't available yet on the video game. I mostly play with new players so I tend to keep it to the more straight forward (as in mechanics, not difficulty) villains.</p><p>On the app, it depends on my mood. Mostly random, but sometimes I go specific if I want a certain type of game. e.g. Plague Rat for pure damage, Miss Information if I want a puzzle, Iron Legacy if I want my backside kicked.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:56:45.199Z",
