      {
        "id": 122936,
        "name": "NinjaMonkey",
        "username": "NinjaMonkey",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/n/67e7ee/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-12T16:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In the app I always go random, re-rolling only if Spite or Miss Information comes up.</p><p>When I play with my group, most of them just pick what they haven't played in awhile, while I gravitate towards KNYFE, Setback, or the Naturalist depending on my mood. For villains and environment we normally just go random, again re-rolling if Spite or Miss Information comes up since we are getting together to actually have fun.</p>",
