        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-04-12T17:34:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>We typically roll randomly for a villain and environment, re-rolling based on what seems fun at the time. Then we pick heroes based on the scenario or whim (I tend to try and spread out my heroes, so if I haven’t played somebody in a while I’m more likely to pick them).</p>",
